WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.260
You need a tray, feathers from a craft store, a scrap of fake fur, two or three

2
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.600
clean empty shells, and animal pictures.

3
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.220
A small piece of raw fish is optional.

4
00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:17.913
Lay a feather, the fur, and a shell on the tray, a hand's width apart.

5
00:00:18.473 --> 00:00:19.793
Keep the pictures face down.

6
00:00:20.213 --> 00:00:23.433
Your child touches each one and finds two words for it.

7
00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:27.247
Put three drops of water on the feather and three on the fur.

8
00:00:27.787 --> 00:00:29.407
Water often beads up on a feather.

9
00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:33.907
Fur varies. Then turn the pictures over and match each covering to its animals.

10
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.400
Stay with your child the whole time.

11
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.840
An adult handles any raw fish, which can carry germs.
